# A duplicate activation starts its read position at the WAL head instead of the
# shared snapshot's coverage, passing entries it never read.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestDuplicateStartsAtHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the duplicate activation starts at the allocator head, not at the snapshot
PERTURBS: Duplicate

--- FIND
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a2"] = snapCov]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the read position is the head, not the snapshot's coverage.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a2"] = next - 1]
--- END
